// Negative fixture: with C-style row-major order, `int g[2][3]`'s outer
// dimension has length 2 - `g[2][0]` must be a runtime bounds error on the
// *outer* index (under the old last-bracket-outermost nesting it would have
// been silently in bounds).
void main() {
    var int g[2][3];
    g[2][0] = 1;
    print(g);
}
